This package bundles text and data derived from the official Adobe Commerce documentation,
including the REST OpenAPI schemas of commerce-webapi. The files in data/ were generated
by scripts/ingerir.ts from the repositories below, at the commits listed. Markdown was
converted (front matter, MDX and Experience League markup removed, includes expanded,
images dropped); the content was not otherwise edited.

